1..11
ok 1 - atomic projector RPC exists
ok 2 - initial fact and journal post together
ok 3 - one initial fact
ok 4 - one initial posted journal
ok 5 - revision reverses and replaces in one transaction
ok 6 - revision creates the next immutable fact
ok 7 - revision creates one reversal
ok 8 - prior journal is marked reversed
ok 9 - replacement and reversal are posted
ok 10 - posted journals reject inserted lines
ok 11 - failed line mutation leaves journal count unchanged
